    "detailed_description": "Dreieck is a fast-paced minimalist top-down shooter set in a dystopian, polygon-based universe.<br>Brace yourself for an adventure as you take on the role of a triangle fighting for survival against polygon-shaped foes with an array of different weapons and skills.<br><br>Explore the expansive areas of this dystopian world and shoot your way to the top of the polygonal social hierarchy to become the ultimate trigon.<br>Scattered throughout the levels are upgrades, weapons, skills, and cosmetics to help you on your ascent.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354050/extras/8d2c1523d78eeb7d251a20854476a46e.poster.avif?t=1730410957\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354050/extras/8d2c1523d78eeb7d251a20854476a46e.webm?t=1730410957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354050/extras/8d2c1523d78eeb7d251a20854476a46e.mp4?t=1730410957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 6 expansive areas to explore, each with its own unique challenges and enemies.<br></li><li> 6 weapons.<br></li><li> 6 skills.<br></li><li> over 40 cosmetics to choose from.<br></li><li> over 20 upgrades.<br></li><li> over 60 different enemies to face.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354050/extras/a668794dc765fed045d1f447df265e97.poster.avif?t=1730410957\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354050/extras/a668794dc765fed045d1f447df265e97.webm?t=1730410957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2354050/extras/a668794dc765fed045d1f447df265e97.mp4?t=1730410957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
